      ],
      "evidence": [
        {
          "artifact": "article",
          "quote": "这个奖励直接针对产生 failure packet 的同一 batch 优化，属于 transductive objective。训练目标没有单独惩罚 held-out regression 或推理成本。"
        },
        {
          "artifact": "article",
